{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>以為普通的雞蛋仔已經沒有驚喜？這款超重口味的「禾蟲雞蛋仔」絕對會打破你的想像！滿滿禾蟲直接鋪滿在鐵模具上，再打入原隻新鮮雞蛋拌勻，視覺衝擊力十足，連在場人士都忍不住驚呼嚇親。\n</p>\n<p>倒入蛋漿烤熟後，雞蛋仔呈現經典外觀，剝開還能清楚看見一條條禾蟲的蹤影與煎蛋完美融合。對於喜歡吃禾蟲的人來說，這絕對是真材實料的極致享受，但一般人恐怕需要極大勇氣才敢放入口。</p>\n<p>你身邊有沒有特別喜歡挑戰暗黑料理的朋友？快點分享給他一起挑戰這款終極重口味小食吧！</p>\n<p>㊙️獵奇指數：🩵🩵🩵🩵🩵<br/>\n🫀勇氣指數：🩵🩵🩵🩵🩵</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179457844586868191_9785757246af7180ebefd6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179457844586868191_9785757246af7180ebefd6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：dashengsheng_official)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfrsFMbvJkx/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/goex/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GOEX</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8d%b5%e5%a5%87%e9%a4%90%e6%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">獵奇餐桌</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%a6%be%e8%9f%b2%e9%9b%9e%e8%9b%8b%e4%bb%94/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">禾蟲雞蛋仔</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：dashengsheng_official資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfrsFMbvJkx/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.557842+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":496,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:57.765343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:16:11.166078+00:00","content_hash":"980c7d5664e24261e1378eaa9ef88e88f0017ab58ad713fd9aef4b766922ac8e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}